  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Would be really helpful if for friends their was a nickname feature that way if you call them something else you can nickname that person so they are easier to remember/jog your memory (these in theory would only be seen by the individual user who gave the person that nickname). Another thing thing place of meeting / time first met this way friends can celebrate vrchat anniversaries (personal milestones) of meetings more easily and people will be easier to identify if they change avatars. Basicaly to help with the current problem of \"where did I meet you again?\" (also help when deciding whether or not to remove a friend)",
